{
  "_comment": [
    "The web E2E matrix: one runner per entry in lint-and-tests.yml, read by bin/ci/e2e-plan.mjs.",
    "`path` is the regex jest matches against each test file's path. An entry is named for what it",
    "covers, never for a file's number: an oversized family is split across runners by naming its",
    "files, small files that share a runner are listed together, so a test's describe title never",
    "decides its runner. Aim for two to four minutes an entry: under that a runner's setup is most of",
    "its time, over it the run's critical path grows.",
    "`tier: nightly` marks a file whose every test is tagged [nightly]: it leaves the per-commit",
    "matrix rather than spend a runner on a suite that would skip everything. docs/TESTS-LAYERS.md § Tiers.",
    "`tmux` runs the entry on that tmux instead of the 3.7a every other entry builds against."
  ],
  "suites": [
    {
      "name": "input",
      "path": "tests/1-input-interaction"
    },
    {
      "name": "layout",
      "path": "tests/2-layout-navigation(-(float|float-minimize|groups|overview|palette|panes|zoom-drag))?\\.test\\.js"
    },
    {
      "name": "layout-tree",
      "path": "tests/2-layout-navigation-(dock|float-scope|group-drag|peek|tree|tree-drag|tree-fields|tree-ports|tree-rows)\\.test\\.js"
    },
    {
      "name": "rendering-text",
      "path": "tests/3-rendering-protocols-(links|unicode)\\.test\\.js"
    },
    {
      "name": "rendering-images",
      "path": "tests/3-rendering-protocols(-images)?\\.test\\.js"
    },
    {
      "name": "session",
      "path": "tests/(snapshots/|4-session-connectivity|4-attach-input)"
    },
    {
      "name": "stress",
      "path": "tests/5-stress-stability.test.js"
    },
    {
      "name": "nvim",
      "path": "tests/6-nvim-performance.test.js",
      "tier": "nightly"
    },
    {
      "name": "regression",
      "path": "tests/7-regression-bugs"
    },
    {
      "name": "tui",
      "path": "tests/8-"
    },
    {
      "name": "tmux-3.4",
      "path": "tests/(snapshots/|8-tui-alternate-screen|7-regression-bugs-run-shell)",
      "tmux": "3.4"
    },
    {
      "name": "webkit",
      "path": "tests/11-webkit.test.js",
      "webkit": true
    },
    {
      "name": "touch",
      "path": "tests/12-touch"
    },
    {
      "name": "permissions",
      "path": "tests/1[34]-(send-permission|widget-authorisation|widget-preview)\\.test\\.js"
    },
    {
      "name": "personalization-plugins",
      "path": "tests/1[678]-(personalization|plugin)"
    },
    {
      "name": "services",
      "path": "tests/(19-mcp|20-push|23-kindle|26-bug-report|27-trace-share|28-trace-replay)\\.test\\.js"
    },
    {
      "name": "agents",
      "path": "tests/2[124]-(agent-states|agent-spawn|process-icons|worktrees)\\.test\\.js"
    },
    {
      "name": "session-snapshot",
      "path": "tests/15-session-snapshot.test.js",
      "tier": "nightly"
    }
  ]
}
